                                                                                                                                               "typeName":  "dsDescriptionValue",
                                                                                                                                               "multiple":  false,
                                                                                                                                               "typeClass":  "primitive",
                                                                                                                                               "value":  "This dataset contains data collected during the 2021 agricultural season in the Bafra Valley (Turkey). In 2021, two irrigation management strategies were tested, cultivating only one rice variety (Rekor CL). The tow irrigation managements were: 1) WFL: dry seeding and immediate field flooding + continuous flooding; 2) 2) AWD(-15): dry seeding and immediate field flooding + alternate wetting and drying (water tube threshold equal to -15 cm below the soil surface). The dataset also includes the experimental field layouts and details of the cultivated rice varieties."
                                                                                                                                           }
                                                                                                                }
